        "created_at": "2016-12-28T17:56:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think what Rabit is saying is that wasn't a discussion that needed to be clarified between Christopher and Handelabra, as it seems to have always worked as intended on the video game (correct me if I'm wrong). Along those lines, I would see why adding it to the Fireside Chat thread would be \"inappropriate,\" per se. Not that there isn't a place for it in a consolidated FAQ.</p>",
