        "created_at": "2016-12-28T18:40:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wait, doesn’t that ruling on Tome and Ammo Drop contradict the general rule that unless a card has on destruction text it’s game text leaves play before effects on other cards that trigger on that card’s destruction trigger?</p>",
